# IP-10C evidence: re-allow the committed pipeline reports under
# reports/model/ even though the root .gitignore *.log rule would otherwise
# drop them. These four files are the durable acceptance evidence; the
# validate/optimize logs are the output of build-model.mjs and the
# structure test demands they be present on a clean checkout.
!reports/model/pre-validate.log
!reports/model/post-validate.log
!reports/model/optimize.log